    "row": 77,
    "name": "Dynamic Sway Reduction",
    "rawHTML": "<tr style=\"height: 89px\"><th id=\"1662574278R76\" style=\"height: 89px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 89px\">77</div></th><td class=\"s14\">Dynamic Sway Reduction</td><td class=\"s26\"><div style=\"width:70px;height:89px;\"><img src=\"https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYxoCydaI3huJctpLZenjOB4zreWsvM-7TZZGN160Nzg580z3WFucDAYWzyoWpRripPKD1GgSHqqcUvWABgZD_zJzGvXjYh-ASFve9Jom8uVB4D8fyKUB7pXEsRet62xO2FrQZ9_xn5XpSgcKXu3RX0RswyCojnWNjE=w70-h89\" style=\"width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;\"/></div></td><td class=\"s16\" colspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">While holding down the trigger:</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><br></span>-?% <span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑-?%</span> Accuracy Cone Size, -10% <span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑-12.5%</span> Accuracy Cone Growth, and +1 Stability per shot.<br>Stacks up to -?% Accuracy Cone Size, -100% Accuracy Cone Growth, and +10 Stability after firing 10 <span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑8</span> shots.<span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">Effect at maximum strength removes all bullet spread and grants higher than initial accuracy.</span></td></tr>",
    "text": "While holding down the trigger: -?% ↑-?% Accuracy Cone Size, -10% ↑-12.5% Accuracy Cone Growth, and +1 Stability per shot. Stacks up to -?% Accuracy Cone Size, -100% Accuracy Cone Growth, and +10 Stability after firing 10 ↑8 shots. Effect at maximum strength removes all bullet spread and grants higher than initial accuracy."
  },
